# AGENTS.md — {{VAULT_NAME}} (provider-neutral)

This file governs any AI agent (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, local models, scripts)
that reads or writes this Brain. It is intentionally provider-neutral: nothing
here depends on a specific AI vendor.

## What this is

A local-first, Markdown-based personal knowledge system. AI is a **client** of
the Brain, not the Brain itself. The system must stay usable from a plain text
editor even with no AI available.

- Canonical source of truth: `{{VAULT_PATH}}/` (this directory).
{{BACKUP_LINE}}- Working code projects live under {{PROJECTS_ROOTS}}. This Brain stores
  **knowledge about** those projects (summaries, decisions, links), never the
  project source code itself. Never copy a project into the Brain.

